#. <CLT 4>ロッカーだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Lockers...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>１つだけ開いているものがあるけど、
#. ここにも何もないみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>One of them is unlocked, but I don't see anything\n"
"inside.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>マッサージチェアがある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a massage chair.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当に疲れたときにお世話になろうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I'll use it once I get really tired...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
